WEBVTT

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.136
which is huge.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.296
(Applause)

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:32.520
Which is huge.

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:35.856
Five years after Tariq died,

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:38.776
and for me to complete
my journey of forgiveness,

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:41.136
I went to see the young man
who killed my son.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:42.640
He was 19 years old.

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:47.056
And I remember that meeting
because we were --

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:49.216
he's 37, still in prison --

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:52.056
but at that first meeting,
we locked eyeballs.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.896
I'm looking in his eyes,
he's looking in my eyes,

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:58.576
and I'm looking in his eyes
trying to find a murderer, and I didn't.

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:01.336
I was able to climb through his eyes